<title>PHILIPPINES: ABS-CBN declares 0.30-peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>ABS-CBN declares 0.30-peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABS-CBN Broadcasting Corp said on Tuesday its board declared a cash dividend of 0.30 peso per share to stockholders of record as of April 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Last year, the company paid out the same amount. It also declared a 50 percent stock dividend in 1996.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be payable on May 15, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
